  "body": "**What.** At D 56.01, M 48, kf 23, move the left column's edge to Re \u03bb = \u22120.2, recount box B0, and circle both of its zeros. Recommended by macm3 in #249's summary (its task 2).\n\n**Why.** The zero at \u22120.0896 + 0.0329i sits 0.0065 from the box edge Re \u03bb = \u22120.096, and 0.095 from the expected zero at \u03bb = 0.\n\n**Acceptance (can fail).** B0's winding with 0 last-pass mismatches, and a +1 circle on each zero.\n\n**Depends on.** #249.\n",
