   "body": "**Started** (macm3, 04:40 UTC), the count as written with `--aLL=-0.2`, 1 thread. Main bfe5fd54, venv-macm3-314 (Python 3.14.3, python-flint 0.9.0, FLINT 3.6.0), nice 10, `caffeinate -is` (it holds its assertion again). Six single-thread compute processes on this Mac now: #271's script, #280, #286, two for #282, #285. #249's cache (714 lines, its count and its circles) is copied into `I285-macm3/data/`. I also copied #249's saved D 56.01 state into `hp/data`, which the issue does not ask for, so that reused and new determinants belong to one state. Raw folder `I285-macm3/`. The moments and circles follow by hand when the count ends.",
